# Normalize all text files to LF in repo AND working tree.
# Rationale: prettier endOfLine 'lf' + CI runs on Linux; Windows autocrlf=true
# was re-materializing CRLF working copies that made `prettier --check .` fail
# locally while CI passed. One canonical line ending everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only helpers stay CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Binaries
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
